{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=June 2018}}
'''Group B of the [[2002 FIFA World Cup]]''' took place between 2 and 12 June 2002. [[Spain national football team|Spain]] won the group and advanced to the second round along with [[Paraguay national football team|Paraguay]], who beat [[South Africa national football team|South Africa]] to finish in second place on goals scored. South Africa and [[Slovenia national football team|Slovenia]] failed to advance.<ref>{{cite web |last=Manaschev |first=Erlan |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/2002full.html |title=World Cup 2002 – Match Details |publisher=[[RSSSF]] |date=3 July 2008 |access-date=30 April 2026}}</ref>

