*Spain advanced to play Republic of Ireland (runner-up of [[2002 FIFA World Cup Group E|Group E]]) in the [[2002 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Spain vs Republic of Ireland|round of 16]].
*Paraguay advanced to play Germany (winner of [[2002 FIFA World Cup Group E|Group E]]) in the [[2002 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Germany vs Paraguay|round of 16]].

